# CPI MCP -- Credentials
# Fill in ALL values from your SAP BTP Service Key.
#
# GUIDE: https://github.<YOUR-DOMAIN>/YOUR-ORG/CPIMAESTRO/blob/main/ONBOARDING.md#step-4
#
# HOW TO GET VALUES:
#   SAP BTP Cockpit -> Service Instances -> Process Integration Runtime -> Service Keys -> View Key
#   url          -> CPI_TENANT_URL
#   tokenurl     -> CPI_TOKEN_URL
#   clientid     -> CPI_CLIENT_ID
#   clientsecret -> CPI_CLIENT_SECRET
#
# AGENTS IMPACTED BY THIS FILE:
#   .env.dev  -> @flowlens-ai, @archflow, @integration-detective (DEV), @gatekeeper-goofy, @c3
#   .env.test -> @integration-detective (TEST), @gatekeeper-goofy (DEV vs TEST)  [optional]
#   .env.prod -> @integration-detective (PROD), @gatekeeper-goofy (PROD)         [optional]
#
# SECURITY: Never commit this file -- it is gitignored

CPI_TENANT_URL=
CPI_TOKEN_URL=
CPI_CLIENT_ID=
CPI_CLIENT_SECRET=
SAP_HUB_API_KEY=
